      "text": "do not even the publicans the same, Matt. 5:46. Why eateth your Master with publicans, Matt. 9:11 (Mark 2:16; Luke 5:30). Matthew the publican, Matt. 10:3. friend of publicans and sinners, Matt. 11:19 (Luke 7:34). publicans and the harlots go into the kingdom of God before you, Matt. 21:31. came also publicans to be baptized, Luke 3:12. publicans, justified God, Luke 7:29. drew near unto him all the publicans, Luke 15:1. one a Pharisee, and the other a publican, Luke 18:10. Zacchæus … chief among the publicans, Luke 19:2.",
